# Line-ending policy: LF everywhere. Reason: render-realm.sh substitutes values
# from *.properties / secrets/*.env into the realm JSON with sed; a CR inside
# a substituted value lands INSIDE a JSON string, which breaks realm parsing
# (Jackson) and crash-loops Keycloak on import. CRLF line endings are harmless
# in YAML/Markdown/shell, but keeping everything LF means no tool in the chain
# ever has to care.
* text=auto eol=lf
